From 60dc63180eeea5ce87d8927a1389d5290b6f8793 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TIROK <dev@tirok.ir>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:52:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: install script, backup/restore API and admin UI

- install.sh: one-liner setup (domain, SSL via certbot, Docker, nginx)
  with optional backup restore during install
- app/api/admin/backup/route.ts: streams site.db + uploads/ as zip download
- app/api/admin/restore/route.ts: accepts zip upload, validates and extracts
  over DATA_DIR with rollback on failure
- components/admin/BackupRestore.tsx: admin panel UI section (download + restore)
- scripts/hash-password.mjs: updated to accept password as CLI arg for installer
- INSTALL_DEPS.md: documents the two new npm packages (archiver, adm-zip)
